{"id":55607,"ord":59,"n_segments":90,"prev":55606,"next":55608,"doc":{"id":"68090","title":"68090_Ed Garland oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Ed Garland","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/68090/","url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=68090"},"chapter":"Later bands, 1950s-70s","title":"Meeting Barry Martin and the Legends of Jazz","category":"band_or_employer","summary":"Garland met Barry Martin at an Ebell concert in 1971; Martin organized the Legends of Jazz and Garland names its members.","period":"1971-72","year_from":1971,"year_to":1971,"words":265,"start":[85,9],"end":[87,13],"url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=68090#s55607","tags":{"places":[{"name":"Europe","focus":0,"type":"region"}],"venues":[{"name":"Ebell","focus":1,"city":"Los Angeles"}],"bands":[{"name":"Legends of Jazz","focus":1,"leader":"Barry Martin"}]},"people":[{"name":"Barry Martin","qid":null,"n":8},{"name":"Joe 'Cornbread' Thomas","qid":null,"n":5},{"name":"Joe Darensbourg","qid":"Q1558304","n":3},{"name":"Ed Garland","qid":"Q1282347","n":2},{"name":"Louis Nelson","qid":"Q6687883","n":1},{"name":"Alton Purnell","qid":"Q443875","n":1},{"name":"Andrew Blakeney","qid":null,"n":1}],"story":{"theme":38,"theme_name":"Still working: current gigs, upcoming projects and plans","community":78,"community_name":"What's next: upcoming tours, records and plans","core":true},"blocks":[{"p":85,"b":9,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"You don't remember who it was. And then around 1971, or '72, you get together with Barry Martin."},{"p":85,"b":10,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"Barry Martin, yeah."},{"p":85,"b":11,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"And then you have the Legend of Jazz, which --"},{"p":85,"b":12,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"That's -- that's Barry Martin."},{"p":85,"b":13,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"Right, how'd you meet Barry Martin?"},{"p":85,"b":14,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"Barry Martin come -- well when he come"},{"p":86,"b":0,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"there we was playing -- we had a concert at the Ebell, Barry Martin brought his band, you know, from over in Europe, a group --"},{"p":86,"b":1,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"Yes."},{"p":86,"b":2,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"-- he played down in the pit."},{"p":86,"b":3,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":86,"b":4,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"That is how I met (First came over and) I saw him Barry, when he had his band to play for us."},{"p":86,"b":5,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"How long ago was that, Tootie?"},{"p":86,"b":6,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"That was in 7--"},{"p":86,"b":7,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"'71? Uh-huh. And then how did the Legends of Jazz get started, how did that start?"},{"p":86,"b":8,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"That's where he start, that's were he organized the band, you know, trying to pick up all the old players, you know."},{"p":86,"b":9,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"So the Legends --"},{"p":86,"b":10,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"And because the Legends of Jazz --"},{"p":86,"b":11,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"Right. That's -- that's Tootie Garland on bass --"},{"p":86,"b":12,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"Yeah."},{"p":86,"b":13,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"And who was the piano?"},{"p":86,"b":14,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"Alton Purnell."},{"p":86,"b":15,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"And then trumpet?"},{"p":86,"b":16,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"Andrew Blakely."},{"p":86,"b":17,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"And the -- Darenbourg played clarinet"},{"p":87,"b":0,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"Clarinet."},{"p":87,"b":1,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"But now who --"},{"p":87,"b":2,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"Louis Nelson on trombone."},{"p":87,"b":3,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"I see."},{"p":87,"b":4,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"Barry on the drums."},{"p":87,"b":5,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"Right. You mentioned earlier that someone else is playing clarinet, Joe is not going out for awhile."},{"p":87,"b":6,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"No, Joe don't travel anymore."},{"p":87,"b":7,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"So who's playing clarinet with the Legends now?"},{"p":87,"b":8,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"Cornbread, his name is Thomas."},{"p":87,"b":9,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"Cornbread Thomas."},{"p":87,"b":10,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"His name is Joe Dodge -- Joe Thomas."},{"p":87,"b":11,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"Uh-huh. So -- from New Orleans."},{"p":87,"b":12,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"Yeah. Old man Cornbread."},{"p":87,"b":13,"s":"","x":"[PAUSE]"}]}